From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:15:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(delegation): resume background subagents after a gateway
 restart

delegation.restart_handoff (false = off): a graceful restart stops each
background subagent at a clean point (out of its tool call, or after
delegation.restart_handoff_grace_seconds) and leaves its unit in the
async_delegations ledger as handed_off, keeping children that finished.
The next gateway adopts the unit and continues each other child from its
stored transcript on its recorded route, under the same delegation id;
the unit then completes and is delivered once, as usual. A tool call cut
by the restart reads as interrupted in the child's transcript.
