+### Background subagents across a gateway restart (opt-in)
+
+Set `delegation.restart_handoff: true` to keep background subagents working
+across a graceful gateway restart (a restart stop, such as `hermes gateway
+restart` or a SIGTERM with `gateway.sigterm_restart_wait`). By default a
+restart interrupts them and the parent gets interrupted results.
+
+With the option on, a restart stop does this before the gateway stops its
+background processes:
+
+1. Each running child stops at a clean point: when it is not inside a tool
+   call, or after `delegation.restart_handoff_grace_seconds` (default 30) at
+   the latest. A tool call cut at that bound gets the result "cancelled:
+   gateway restart" in the child's transcript. A model call that was running
+   is sent again after the restart.
